    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/2998a753258b56bd2602b783e4c56190.poster.avif?t=1728241425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/2998a753258b56bd2602b783e4c56190.webm?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/2998a753258b56bd2602b783e4c56190.mp4?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Fort Craft is a simulation game in which you conquer and manage forts and also fight battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in the siege, then make the reconstruction, and be prepared for defense of your fortification.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become Fortification Master ! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repair walls, build reinforced cannon posts, rearrange fort for your needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/74cadaa1af3fb2d02ccf7cde06690fa9.poster.avif?t=1728241425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/74cadaa1af3fb2d02ccf7cde06690fa9.webm?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/74cadaa1af3fb2d02ccf7cde06690fa9.mp4?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rebuild the Fort</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather required materials, make plans and stay prepared</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/a4b51cb4a572979610cc405e854d21be.poster.avif?t=1728241425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/a4b51cb4a572979610cc405e854d21be.webm?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/a4b51cb4a572979610cc405e854d21be.mp4?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Conquer and win campaigns on tactical map ! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the best tactics and combined arms to win battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/d732c8cb2989730a4763749f0741d946.poster.avif?t=1728241425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/d732c8cb2989730a4763749f0741d946.webm?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/d732c8cb2989730a4763749f0741d946.mp4?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover and Conquer new territories !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out 3 different campaigns all around the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/dc1a587ae6d179106b3475e12076d1c3.poster.avif?t=1728241425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/dc1a587ae6d179106b3475e12076d1c3.webm?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/dc1a587ae6d179106b3475e12076d1c3.mp4?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build new better cannons, prepare your fort for the worst ! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/6ba01177051ea3688d02770f219b8da2.poster.avif?t=1728241425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/6ba01177051ea3688d02770f219b8da2.webm?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to use a full set of tools to maintain support for your soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each fort has its own stories and secrets to discover, you could find blueprints for the new cannon or a bunch of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to take care of the morale and needs of your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will offer FPP and TPP mode.</p>",
